      "act": "FRAMEWORK",
      "role_note": "FRAMEWORK beat -- the boot path every request depends on, shown before the example",
      "narration_text": "Here's the path every request depends on. Cloud Run starts a container. Gunicorn binds to port eighty-eighty. The app imports its routes, and that import calls init database, which asks MongoDB's client to resolve the cluster's address through DNS. Every link has to hold before even the health check can answer.",
