    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "DIAGNOSIS",
      "role_note": "the crash-loop pattern -- reconstruction from incident notes, labeled",
      "narration_text": "The logs showed a loop. Gunicorn starts and binds to eighty-eighty. A few seconds later the worker crashes, the worker fails to boot, and the master shuts down. Then it repeats, on every single request, because with no healthy instance Cloud Run starts a fresh one each time. At the bottom of the traceback: pymongo trying to resolve the cluster's DNS records, and failing.",
      "shot": {
