      "act": "ROOT CAUSE",
      "role_note": "the framework from B03 again, now with the broken link lit",
      "narration_text": "So I opened the secret's actual value. The MongoDB URI pointed at an old cluster, a personal one from before the project consolidated onto Professor Tayyar's institutional Atlas account. That cluster had been terminated. The DNS lookup had nothing left to find, and the chain broke at its very first database call.",
