    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "act": "FIX",
      "role_note": "resolution steps from the incident notes",
      "narration_text": "The fix. A new, properly owned dev cluster under the institutional Atlas account, seeded with example test data, with no real patient records. Seeding it surfaced a separate index-name issue, a story for another video. Then a new version of the MongoDB URI secret. No redeploy needed: the service reads that secret's latest version, so the next container to boot picked it up.",
